# Sonara AI Voice-Clone Detection - Environment Configuration

# FastAPI Backend Service URL
# For local development: http://127.0.0.1:8000
# For deployed backend (Render / Fly.io / AWS): https://sonara-api.onrender.com
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000

# Supabase Configuration
# Create a project on https://supabase.com
# Execute schema in README.md to initialize tables: scans, users, alerts
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here
